[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024322064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108164#issuecomment-3024322064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108164","id":3024322064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60Q34Q","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-01T14:37:05Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T14:37:05Z","body":"Can confirm on `v4.4.1.stable` on Arch Linux\n\n`res://addons/myplugin/inspector.gd` is not a `@tool` script indeed, but that seems like a red herring, because adding it doesn't change any behavior (and the script extends `EditorInspectorPlugin`, and the [related tutorial](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/editor/inspector_plugins.html#interacting-with-the-inspector) doesn't specify that @tool is needed for this to work properly)\n\nWhen running locally, the provided object is indeed a `SomeClass`. But when debugging, the object received is actually `EditorDebuggerRemoteObject`. More confusingly, it reports being of type `SomeClass`, but them attempting to use its methods doesn't work:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1960606d-f3ce-47b2-bd24-d4bec712c7cf","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024322064/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024682803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108164#issuecomment-3024682803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108164","id":3024682803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60SP8z","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-01T16:14:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T16:19:04Z","body":"I can't reproduce the error in 4.5.beta.\n\nThe result in the remote inspector is expected. Note that it shows an `ObjectID` instead of a `SomeClass` reference. The running project communicates with the editor by serializing values over the network but references can't be serialized. What the remote inspector shows is a list of the of the object's properties encoded as basic types instead of the object itself. The inspector plugin has no effect because none of these fields are actually of type `SomeClass`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024682803/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3035441492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108164#issuecomment-3035441492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108164","id":3035441492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc607SlU","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T10:30:22Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T10:30:22Z","body":"Indeed, this looks fixed on the upcoming release (tested on `v.4.5.beta.2`), thank you @ydeltastar!\n\n@xTyrix can you please test and confirm if everything works correctly for you in the new betas? If yes, please close this issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3035441492/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]